ophialabs.ca`) submission paths in every Markdown report.\n2. **Branch Topology \u0026 Expanded Credential Scrubber (`substrate/cli/cmd_issue_scrub.go`)**:\n   - Replaced raw `ActiveBranch` output with `BranchTopology` (`trunk`, `task-worktree`, `detached`, `custom-branch`, `unknown`) via `classifyBranchTopology`.\n   - Added `sanitizeDiagnosticText` redacting `\u003crepo-root\u003e` folder names, POSIX home paths, GitHub PATs, OpenAI/Anthropic/AWS/Google/Slack tokens, `Bearer` headers, PEM private keys, and credentials across all URI schemes (`https`, `postgres`, `mysql`, `redis`, `mongodb`, `amqp`).\n3. **Local Anomaly Ring Buffer \u0026 `nomos task sync` Surfacing (`substrate/cli/diagnostics_anomaly.go`, `substrate/cli/root.go`, `substrate/cli/cmd_verify.go`, `substrate/cli/cmd_task_lifecycle.go`, `substrate/cli/cmd_task_sync.go`)**:\n   - Implemented `RecordSubstrateAnomaly` and a bounded 32-entry `0700` cache ring buffer (`\u003cUserCacheDir\u003e/nomos/diagnostics/`) recording recovered CLI panics (`internal_panic`), `ERR_CORE`/`ERR_SUBSTRATE` errors (`substrate_error`), slow DoD gates `\u003e= 5000ms` (`gate_slow`), and `\u003e= 4x` repeated single-task gate failures (`gate_thrash`).\n   - Wired `renderTaskSyncAnomalyAlert` into `cleanupAndAnnounceSyncedTask` so operators receive a deterministic one-time alert during `nomos task sync` whenever tool friction occurred during a task.\n4. **Verification Suite (`substrate/cli/cmd_issue_test.go`)**:\n   - Added table-driven unit tests in `cmd_issue_test.go` covering `TC-ISS-01` through `TC-ISS-06`.\n\n## Verification\n- Verified `substrate/cli` unit tests (`TestSanitizeDiagnosticTextAndBranchTopology`, `TestIssueCmdOfflineDefaultAndNonInteractiveWebGuard`, `TestIssueCmdDryRunAndClear`, `TestSubstrateAnomalyLedgerAndSyncAlert`): PASS.\n- `nomos verify`: `42/42` Gates Satisfied.\n","sha256_receipt":"36aa9191f9128d2c5b79a6fe3910c4fa204755958ebc98730833b698201660fd"}
